{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_title", "source_sha256": "a43e0025a1172dd9e11df943c2df19ea29c036d64a0f01d9d386524c51eca25c", "ja": "だから自分はここにいる", "zh": "所以我才在这里", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_synopsis", "source_sha256": "629d6eb65b0d8e7b21927cca01b2a4f150950fb382817030f19c9d5eb51df70e", "ja": "新鋭の芸能事務所にスカウトされた響。ダン\nスで世界のトップを目指せると聞き心が揺れ\n動き、そんな己を恥じる。しかしプロデュー\nサーや仲間の言葉で、改めてここが自分の\n居場所だと再認識するのだった。", "zh": "响被新锐演艺事务所挖角。听说能凭借舞蹈\n问鼎世界顶峰，她的内心不禁动摇，并为此感到\n羞愧。但在制作人和同伴的话语中，她再次\n坚信，这里才是属于自己的容身之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "4608098826e5cc1055870730e168b67c02236ea63ce368be22c53fda57d16225", "ja": "ふぅ。今日の収録はびっくりしたね。水じゃなくて\nボールのプールで泳ぐゲームなんて、初めてだったぞ。", "zh": "呼。今天的录制真让人吃惊啊。第一次见到在球池里游泳的游戏，居然不是在水里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "5fcce8057f21a62f606a288d9f7cb0b61b1ace1a7fe05fa2a4445f96c2871ae6", "ja": "けど、杏奈は得点アップのボールまで見つけて大活躍\nだったね！　カワウソの格好も可愛かったし♪", "zh": "不过，杏奈还找到了能增加分数的球，表现得特别活跃呢！她那身水獭装也很可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "dc6eedf521d6cdc9a9d676baf6e8b3c9ca482fbf2e2c0a36f987f0c811556850", "ja": "響さんも……、最後のビーバーのポーズ、\nみんな、盛り上がってた……。", "zh": "响姐姐……最后的海狸姿势，\n大家都很兴奋……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "39c27b28b3e880f33d6bd13675be65043adbcc8bb79925610ec2aab1a8d52d1f", "ja": "えへへ、ああいうのはちょっと恥ずかしいんだけど……\nまあ、仕事だからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那种动作虽然让人有点害羞……\n不过，毕竟是工作嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "8eea53a39fdfb89b58f54d50f6169d237553604548421d90c33854fb87e9cedb", "ja": "でも、もうちょっと体を動かしたい気分かなー。\n杏奈、帰ったらダンスレッスン、つきあってくれる？", "zh": "不过，我现在有点想再活动活动身体呢——\n杏奈，回去后陪我一起上舞蹈课，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1005_se", "source_sha256": "fcbe34e9a319b880d975e94771dbd21aabf2488e0f47ab2f67a6eb9644efd187", "ja": "カツ、カツ、カツ……", "zh": "嗒、嗒、嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1006_unknown2", "source_sha256": "37a694efb7b3232c8479921fa3cbdf2ad13590c81e7e5b9b53b7d0ae3bb033b1", "ja": "失礼、我那覇響さんですね。", "zh": "打扰了，您就是我那霸响先生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "9297e29bf2102a22f58904b1e77fdf6a16a8dd64f594f6a886a3e61a3dc309a9", "ja": "……誰？　自分たちに用事？", "zh": "……你是谁？找我们有事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1008_unknown2", "source_sha256": "aa374336d71e3587d1d3943a6268adcdf7f142a3266f086425e976f1b72c4522", "ja": "いえ、望月杏奈さんも大変魅力的な方ですが、\n私共が求めているのは……貴方です、我那覇響さん。", "zh": "不，望月杏奈小姐固然也是一位极富魅力的人，\n但我们所寻求的……是您，我那霸响先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1009_unknown2", "source_sha256": "bfddf997d18cff60c4c5ebb215c6405b65109a10e9afc4b6c2cd3828ab205aac", "ja": "申し遅れました。\n私、こういう者です。", "zh": "忘了自我介绍。  \n我就是这样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "fff2c9d4dc2443693ee56774ec751dd20c83fb21647557eb573b4ce60db8085e", "ja": "『株式会社パンドラステージ』代表取締役……？", "zh": "“潘多拉舞台株式会社”的董事长……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1011_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "863d0d4b63f56796c53a458a8a7ef15988bd074639e0883856b67e9739918260", "ja": "私共は、主にダンサーやパフォーマーのプロデュースを\n手掛けているプロダクションです。", "zh": "我们是一家主要负责制作舞者和表演者的事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1012_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "838663bad4862b384b9c9c3b69c6a597832000833dd40079565dab41d2ec3e21", "ja": "社歴は浅いですが、大手にも負けないプロモーション力\nやコネクションを持っていると、自負していまして。", "zh": "虽然公司成立时间不长，但我们自信在推广能力和人脉资源上，丝毫不逊色于大公司。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1013_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "08d23045039af8569c8592530f108835343eaff8b9869036b490b89be4a989ca", "ja": "先日もNYのトップアーティストと仕事をしたばかり\nです。間もなくこちらでも情報解禁されるかと。", "zh": "前些天才刚和纽约的顶尖艺人合作过。相关消息应该很快也会在这边公开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "9cf61590f7a5e3ecee4b40f4a7b62cc3e8886bde3ceb9b50e8209acae36cf73f", "ja": "ふーん？　そのプロダクションが、何の用？", "zh": "哦？那家事务所找我有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1015_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "a6972e7b31040f77a6a7aabd089cc3e81b26ee5bdfdba7abbc7ad00f50831b46", "ja": "では単刀直入に。\n我那覇響さん、私共の事務所に移籍しませんか？", "zh": "那么我就直说了。\n我那霸响先生，要不要转来我们事务所？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "69283886dc953596e52d7c14623815be2ee25153ce52bdcad9d9a52499a4e4b0", "ja": "えぇ～っ！？", "zh": "诶～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "98031b49fa509f9534015c73431ba41a167dd2c2cc3efabc4a975d1f95dd8f2e", "ja": "何言ってるのー！？　自分、もう765プロの\nアイドルだぞ？", "zh": "你在说什么啊——！？我可是已经出道765年的偶像了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1020_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "dad07f878bfed49607e15d1ea276c225bf19c000630cd363dfa0ddb77945d435", "ja": "はい。ですが私共であれば、貴方の真の力を引き出し、\n輝かせることができると確信しています！", "zh": "是的。不过，我们确信，若由我们来做，一定能够引出您真正的力量，让您绽放光彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1021_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "ab8f72e6205fba7008b04d555efd934904ee15594983aa4e26e4821ccbe14039", "ja": "貴方の才能は凄まじい！　特にダンス＆ボーカルの\nパフォーマンスにおいては群を抜いている。", "zh": "您的才能惊人！尤其是在舞蹈与歌唱的\n表演方面，更是出类拔萃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1022_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "bb0f209f38a7e959aeedf4e8eba7696b9a1c2f0d62e1093c851962bed9effe5d", "ja": "一つの劇場という小さな舞台ではなく、ショービジネス\n界のトップに立てる可能性が、間違いなくあります！", "zh": "你们绝对有可能登上演艺界的顶峰，而不只是站在一个剧场这方小小的舞台上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "3dc69f431d7c06db3717e84753595039dfe85b42b1a1fd9759a11b44b7e80214", "ja": "え……。トップ……？", "zh": "诶……顶尖……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1024_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "2fffa2e4e8c46f11ad5bedac2f2b6088e3bcc8b96f09a4f2d597dca0107a9f3b", "ja": "そうです。先日の天体公演でも確信しました。貴方は\n誰の目をも奪うダイヤモンド。類まれな貴石の原石！", "zh": "没错。在前些日子的天体公演中，我也确信了这一点。您是会夺走所有人目光的钻石，是世所罕见的宝石原石！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "4112c85ff3bc72db1defbf950b41b99526083329b570a49dba9e0d27341ea824", "ja": "え……えへへ。まあ、自分でも、\nこないだの公演はカンペキだったと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶……嘿嘿。嗯，我自己也觉得，\n前几天的公演表现得很完美……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1027_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "6760009f6427bd3b21a9fd1510d45342d002e979b91d7c453ee91c4c74085adf", "ja": "ですがまだまだ、もっと上を目指せます。宝石は磨かれ\nてこそ輝くもの。ぬるいバラエティ番組ではなく……。", "zh": "不过，还能继续向更高处努力。宝石只有经过打磨\n才能绽放光芒。不是那种不痛不痒的综艺节目……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1028_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "9b41b71addac78b39e3aeb7a516b4be423dc0025903115c6a22a879354477369", "ja": "本気のトップアーティストたちと鎬を削るような\n世界最高の舞台を、貴方も求めているのでは？", "zh": "与真正顶尖的艺术家们一较高下的世界最高舞台，您不也正是在追求这样的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "7d96d995b4584fb3c33d5d3933e9f09b3fa877e6dbb3b3de3d9ae24e4631c6b9", "ja": "世界、最高……。", "zh": "世界第一……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1030_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "55bfa4be06c0c0d2871b4dbc47403162869fabbcb7054e71419818b40ca623e0", "ja": "私共ならばその場を用意できます。そして貴方を、その\n舞台に立たせるとお約束しましょう。ですから……。", "zh": "如果是我们，就能为您准备好那个场合。并且，我们向您保证，一定会让您站上那座舞台。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1031_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "bc5822618ed621080e21cd83698a3214a1fa17728f426fe306173906637276bf", "ja": "どうか、私共の事務所に。\n……さあ、参りましょう！", "zh": "还请加入我们的事务所。  \n……那么，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "faccb62155b43e46bf08522bb3bf1297c9ff24d7a0791b6ca070a7872de3b1c7", "ja": "あ、あの……っ！", "zh": "啊、那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebeb2c7405a6a0daf05c9a3c1991561e5915958e794d893108f5002b2c8ad086", "ja": "……！　ち、ちょっと待って！\nそんな簡単に行くわけないでしょ！？", "zh": "……！等、等一下！\n怎么可能会那么简单就去啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "fff623387086f7d916f172a9c0f776161f74aa6fee369a1b4b8c0e6264d34756", "ja": "あ、簡単とかじゃなくて、えっと……自分、自分は……\nううっ、とにかく行かないからね！　杏奈、帰ろっ！", "zh": "啊，不是说简单不简单，那个……我、我只是……\n呜呜，总之我才不去呢！杏奈，我们回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1035_daityoutorisimariyaku", "source_sha256": "c9fb3c241775b04e7ed14566b6ad340e950813687ff29e488f71469e4edd3f0c", "ja": "……そうですか。では、その気になったらいつでも\nご連絡ください。私共は、貴方を待っています……。", "zh": "……这样啊。那么，等您想好了，随时联系我们。我们会等着您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb05b19cc0e4ac7c60bcc7a3154ecf6c8b79a50f158e708b8e32df23948e4be7", "ja": "…………。\nあの……、響、さん……？", "zh": "…………。\n那个……响，小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "3aae0dbb1fee06404a83311503c6f4ca7cfd09df4f93122c6b88500f4d1332e9", "ja": "うぎゃーーーっ！\n杏奈、ごめん！　自分は裏切り者だーーーっ！", "zh": "呜呀——！\n杏奈，对不起！我是个叛徒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb899378895d05617985bab535c2f8f25f48a9cac1cb9f170e9c6abce3f32959", "ja": "えっ！？　響さん……、行っちゃう、の？", "zh": "诶！？　响前辈……要走、了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "0402cbeba2f4bf2e53f6c391e426ca72c63d8f53de956f9f06a80f530bb4baf0", "ja": "行かないっ、行くわけない！　でも……ちょっとだけ、\nちょっとだけ揺れちゃったんだ、世界って聞いて……。", "zh": "不走的，怎么可能走！但是……就那么一瞬间，\n就那么一瞬间动摇了，听到\"世界\"这个词的时候……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "4924fecd89a783f1585860052597ee31ee0d3dd1e8460de917fa673be551969f", "ja": "ずっとみんなと頑張ってきたのに。\n毎日一緒に頑張ってるのに……うう、自分の薄情者～！", "zh": "明明一直以来都和大家一起努力的。\n明明每天都一起努力……呜呜，我真是个薄情鬼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "a51fdecb8dd34ce26b302dd5ac72dff510d98e4f1cebe9a9b8f506302565b91a", "ja": "響さん……。", "zh": "响……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "42b33ccf17682a1e577899b1f0f8e1b58d236934eafd343c10f0233be2e3bf41", "ja": "あんなに、褒められたら……杏奈も、ドキドキする……\n響さんは、薄情じゃ……ない、よ？", "zh": "被那样夸奖的话……杏奈也会心跳加速……\n响小姐并不是……薄情的人……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1044_013hib", "source_sha256": "b4b7036902cbe3b2841696ac25fead30e0f4d9fa4ca76c3f64597b95da45c10b", "ja": "うん……。ありがと、杏奈……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，杏奈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1045_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "e3e901aaba845efc88c50f78504fcf287502465d3f0fdce1755ac4d36820f2c4", "ja": "ただいま……。\n{$P$}、いる……？", "zh": "我回来了……  \n{$P$}在吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "2b3cf6991acb5f312d4344a121c6240c7be0a64d6dc9455944e72e0da487359a", "ja": "あっ、響！　待ってたんだよ、早く早く！", "zh": "啊，响！我一直在等你呢，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "ce7831d632d1bb78a7686aa636e91d458a996c8cb5867094aff47c1e4ca8b650", "ja": "え？　……な、なに？", "zh": "诶？……怎、怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1049_p", "source_sha256": "d39094a0b7960cea7e95d52a468257417eb58eb0d4865a72b1c5c77315ba501a", "ja": "響、杏奈、収録お疲れさま。じつは……。", "zh": "响、杏奈，录音辛苦了。其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1050_p", "source_sha256": "b994a1ec786c2b77bb2fcc1b4a38047eb383904a04ea3bdb7fbf0364ea12f9b3", "ja": "『Next Life』公演用の衣装と演出の草案ができた\nから、見てもらおうと思って。……どうだ？", "zh": "《Next Life》公演用的服装和演出方案已经拟好了，所以想让你看看。……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1051_013hib", "source_sha256": "37d07bc442a05092eaa76d01a632e2d0c65e894d550a7b4af2ebf879607fc3b9", "ja": "！　これ……！？", "zh": "！这……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "e2ba839376ff4ee5baecbc76a9eafb4e674a0c207e355ac564187f449fb16a33", "ja": "すごい……かっこいい……♪", "zh": "好厉害……好帅……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1053_043nor", "source_sha256": "ff5435f57e2106472752239fcf833d69c3f6966402c7af5b616f269bdecc5163", "ja": "だよねー！　クールでスタイリッシュっていうの？\n衣装もなんか強そうだし！　響にぴったりじゃない？", "zh": "对吧——！该说是又酷又时尚吗？\n服装看起来也很强的样子！和响不是很相配吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "f9d5598044e90e03e8d08ca6d3b8941d74a092d648be73386b93b3f26e8080a3", "ja": "不敵でつよつよの我那覇さん。後ろから見つめつつ、\nひたすら踊るのが楽しみです。……ミスに注意。", "zh": "注视着气势逼人、强得不得了的我那霸小姐的背影，光是想象着不停跳舞就让人期待。……不过要注意别出错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1055_009rit", "source_sha256": "5401c5d063877e97122b4effa8e1d81e873a110fe0bad21022ac1dcfce5d7d01", "ja": "響は明るくて元気って印象も強いから、こういうのは\nいい意味で、期待を裏切れるんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "因为响给人的印象就是开朗又有活力，所以这种表演说不定能以好的方式出乎大家的意料呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1056_009rit", "source_sha256": "0560472f3f359ffdbbb77604a6a394c5288580ce63ec0bc121a1333e37a662ea", "ja": "もちろん、本格派でやり切る実力も必要だけど。\nまあ、そこは信頼ですか？", "zh": "当然也需要有实力走专业路线，坚持到底才行。不过，这方面就要靠信任了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1057_p", "source_sha256": "83a43b9e50a1b3034f864fe5b85b30abadb4a363c2dff86d36ad5f5c3e6debcc", "ja": "そんなところかな。……どうだ？　響。", "zh": "大概就是这样吧。……怎么样？　响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1058_013hib", "source_sha256": "39b583a9b4d715c871deded22d2c4a1291dbc0d0f91a040ba14a2017839286e4", "ja": "すごい……すごいぞ、{$P$}……。\n自分、これやりたい、絶対……！", "zh": "好厉害……真的好厉害，{$P$}……\n我绝对想做这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1059_p", "source_sha256": "bfe10a8b450e87ff429073612741d5315b985b9e264be7825a2d6eab9e35c754", "ja": "よかった。じゃあこの方向性で進めるよ。", "zh": "太好了。那就按这个方向推进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1060_013hib", "source_sha256": "935545449c34a58dbe0e2c4c084a37cc1d7da16833fdedfceb6bf04fceee4a49", "ja": "でも……なんで？　こういうの、自分のイメージと……\nアイドルのイメージとは、ちょっと違うよね？", "zh": "但是……为什么？这种风格，和我心中的形象……\n和偶像的形象，感觉有点不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1061_013hib", "source_sha256": "d7c9fdca99d4020a97dbfcbe894f107cf24a72c438799ebad2edfcd87d9082dc", "ja": "なのに、なんでこういうのがいいって思ったの？\n……曲が、かっこいい曲だから？", "zh": "明明是这样，你为什么会觉得这种不错？\n……是因为这首歌很帅气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1062_p", "source_sha256": "0353ad4c7b7921c2c55ab41d7b9de77ac97d9953a75b3a53ca166bdbaef2f912", "ja": "ん？　もちろんそれもあるけど。\n何より、響がかっこいいからだ。", "zh": "嗯？那当然也是原因之一。\n但最重要的，是因为响很帅气啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1063_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c731fc9cd954d914e76a15737dd10ef526c2dee233690d29b389218eaed3dd5", "ja": "かっ……。", "zh": "好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1064_p", "source_sha256": "f9347be127005adf8a4dc88444d2b7421e0a5feec825e74d3af5bee948ddc353", "ja": "バラエティで明るく笑ったり、失敗して慌てたり。\n楽しくてかわいい、親しみやすいのも響の魅力だし……", "zh": "在综艺节目里开朗地笑，失败时又慌慌张张的。\n活泼可爱、平易近人也是响的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1065_p", "source_sha256": "aa37981f04e3b3810b6bf6f35d6fe85f5965701f1d4efe93e4e52ccf0ad675b9", "ja": "ダンスが凄くて、クールでスタイリッシュに\n決められるのも響の魅力だ。", "zh": "舞蹈很厉害，能够以帅气又时尚的风格惊艳全场，也是响的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1066_p", "source_sha256": "5814f5d14f5a83c7f659e0a885e7be9058b8ec2ef95b44a2c352ecb6ecaf96d5", "ja": "どれも本当の響だし、全部に全力なのが響だと思う。\n今回は、かっこよさに本気を出してもらいたい。", "zh": "那些全都是真正的响，我觉得全力以赴做好每一件事的她，才是响。\n这次，我想让她拿出全力，展现出帅气的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1067_p", "source_sha256": "6e9673fbc0043a832b0a40748c30d5cef2cd424ad70845f3ad7380d0efa45c94", "ja": "響は、なにか一つのジャンルのパフォーマーじゃなくて\n本人まるごと全部が魅力の……アイドルだからな。", "zh": "响不是只擅长某一种类型的表演者，而是本身的一切都充满魅力的……偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1068_013hib", "source_sha256": "8557b8d8b16a00affb3642e857da7cb0a91cad6ebe95d1ced71c969f2fd74781", "ja": "アイドル…………。", "zh": "偶像…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1069_013hib", "source_sha256": "b3b45a410947c2d63d5e76ef0565031db826ca8d44f36e8dd815ab909745201a", "ja": "う……。うう……。", "zh": "呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1070_013hib", "source_sha256": "40236939e035416277ae55d9434cf812a6f6a24404ad6487a48324b1d60629f9", "ja": "うわーーーん！！　そうだ、そうだぞ！\nやっぱり自分は、765プロのアイドルなんだ～！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！！对啊，就是这样！\n自己果然是765事务所的偶像啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1071_043nor", "source_sha256": "f007c67d30c646f7c6947fc05ffaed61530fb1babfcaeca9973d92cb51ac121a", "ja": "えっ！？　ちょ、どうしたの、響？", "zh": "诶！？等、怎么了，响？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1072_013hib", "source_sha256": "a28ab8a4c14455f57498d65f92250bd7d08eedd4b5b797a40728561ce63f13aa", "ja": "自分はダンスが得意で、頑張ったらもっとうまく\nなって、どんどん強くなってくみたいで……", "zh": "我很擅长跳舞，只要努力就好像能变得越来越厉害，\n也会变得越来越强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1073_013hib", "source_sha256": "8e264a7a1f0bebca0404c65a1686f3bf9f1b43a2b18969b2c47a7f41c29a7d20", "ja": "もっと上に行きたくて、負けたくなくて、一番になると\n体中から力があふれてきて、もっと強くなりたくて……", "zh": "因为想登上更高处，不想输，成为第一名时，身体里就会涌出力量，还想变得更强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1074_013hib", "source_sha256": "6cd7a032ffae3b7081bd8588ec7f7ac1b73f53c1a84dd79c73d75bd545b58f69", "ja": "でも全部、みんなと一緒だったからできたんだ！\nここにいたから、なのに……浮気者っ！", "zh": "但这一切，都是因为有大家陪着我，我才能做到的！  \n因为我一直在这里，可是……你这个花心鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1075_013hib", "source_sha256": "0f0c51ccfe1639d39fa26be414f5d9b16ae7d8921477b0ebb7a05e25e64fde26", "ja": "というわけで、ごめん！　{$P$}！", "zh": "所以说，对不起！{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1076_p", "source_sha256": "838fb886be9a6cff28ec143aae68bd364668bca830baead92214659882315eb2", "ja": "えっ、いや、どういうわけで……？", "zh": "诶？不，怎么就“所以”了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1077_013hib", "source_sha256": "6a0f22b961e26ffdc990d089cf72f4adb6b1ef50fc2a22d9df55967e4b7820b0", "ja": "みんなも、ごめん！　今の自分がいるのは、\nみんなとのここでの時間があったからだぞ！", "zh": "也对不起大家！正因为有和大家一起度过的这段时光，才有了现在的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1078_043nor", "source_sha256": "f981dbd6c9376e8431c87053092ed0f48149ab659c84dcfdc390d21366c7a60a", "ja": "いったいどうしたの？　なんの話？", "zh": "到底怎么了？你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1079_024ann", "source_sha256": "5b36e7c0be27a2f67d59a9c9503b857c3360ff50a47781c6d96e9b9bb1f572c5", "ja": "えと、つまり……\n響さんは……、みんなが、大好きって……。ね？", "zh": "呃，也就是说……\n响……最喜欢大家了……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1080_013hib", "source_sha256": "282e2db5534e852d6874d4eec35c0a07d1bf610cc628d5f10764fe5f87cd3614", "ja": "うん、そう！　自分はみんなが、\n765プロのみんなが……大好きだーーー！！", "zh": "嗯，就是这样！我最喜欢大家了，\n765位制作人，我最喜欢大家——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1081_044miz", "source_sha256": "877bc6d0217eca0afc8e9a4c8e6eb1120be2b3c34f8a7fded84218c1225deb2e", "ja": "なんと。熱烈な告白を受けてしまいました。", "zh": "没想到，竟然收到了如此热烈的告白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1082_043nor", "source_sha256": "173109fc36e5b7ca96ebcf6efe9866085934c80354c8cd17867032caed2682e0", "ja": "ど、どうしよう瑞希。\nこれ、なんか返事とかするべき？", "zh": "怎、怎么办啊，瑞希。\n这个……是不是该回应一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1083_044miz", "source_sha256": "83d193bff96dfbfa7b3fbadc959be20315e6970af40bca0d5b41a52017236d46", "ja": "わかりません。ですが、真心には真心で応えましょう。\nというわけで、私も好きです、我那覇さん。……ぽっ。", "zh": "我不知道。不过，既然是真心，就用真心回应吧。\n所以，我也喜欢你，我那霸小姐。……脸红。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_148_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_148_1084_043nor", "source_sha256": "860ba6c1e8b25e20b96a0f6666e76160498b3fa6e8d5b875d8abdba1b016d086", "ja": "あ、もちろんアタシもだよ！\n響ってすごいし、尊敬してる！　だ、大好き！", "zh": "啊，当然我也是啊！\n响真的很厉害，我很尊敬她！最、最喜欢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
